tah-county"],["ARC or PLC in Latah County","/arc-plc/idaho/latah-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on Latah County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids July to August came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years. In 2025 that middle ran 17% of normal in June to July and 33% in May to June. So far in 2026, June to July sits at 39% of normal on the middle. Every grid here had its driest year in 1952, with grid 32152 at 70% of normal.</p>"}
